{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Frontend, Liquid, and CSS developer. Build a fully responsive custom section that 100% replicates the layout, design language, spacing, and typography of the cards provided in the reference image.
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the active storefront typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), page maximum layout width wrappers (e.g., `.page-width` or `.container`), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** On desktop viewports, layout the section as a symmetrical 3-column horizontal card row with a comfortable gap (approx. 24px) separating each card. On mobile layouts, columns must collapse into a vertical stack with equal spacing.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable top and bottom padding.
    
    ### 2. Card Grid Architecture & Modular Block Styles
    Build the section using a dynamic block loop (`{% for block in section.blocks %}`) so that each card can be managed, added, or reordered independently. Each card container must feature:
    - **Card Styling:** An ultra-soft, light gray-blue or off-white background wash with smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px) and a very thin, faint outer border stroke.
    - **Card Padding:** Deep, even internal padding to frame the text elements comfortably.
    
    ### 3. Internal Card Typography & Content Elements
    Inside each card block, items are left-aligned and vertically stacked as follows:
    - **Header Badge Row:** A horizontal flex layout containing:
      - **Icon Asset Box:** A small, square light-gray background box with smooth rounded corners containing a clean, thin-line inline SVG icon (e.g., exclamation mark, group/people outline, clock/timer outline).
      - **Eyebrow Label:** Small, muted, uppercase gray text positioned to the right of the icon (e.g., "BLIND SPOT 01").
    - **Card Title:** Large, prominent, bold text using a deep navy blue color theme (#0A2240) positioned below the badge row.
    - **Main Paragraph Body:** Medium-weight, slate-gray text outlining the problem statement with a comfortable line-height for scannability.
    - **Divider Rule:** A very thin, subtle horizontal rule breaking the main body and the footer text.
    - **Footer Section Group:** Left-aligned beneath the divider rule containing:
      - **Footer Label:** A small, lower-contrast slate-gray text string reading "What you can't answer:".
      - **Footer Quote Text:** Small, italicized or lower-contrast slate-gray text enclosed in straight quotation marks, presenting the specific unanswered question.
    
    ### 4. Exact Content Mapping for 100% Replication
    Ensure the default theme presets or block settings contain the following English copy verbatim:
    
    #### CARD 1 (Left):
    - **Eyebrow Label:** BLIND SPOT 01
    - **Title:** Unknown Conversion Rate
    - **Main Body:** POS records transactions. It does not record how many customers walked in. Without that number, conversion rate is unknown — and an unknown rate cannot be managed.
    - **Footer Quote:** "Were sales low because traffic was low, or because we failed to convert?"
    
    #### CARD 2 (Center):
    - **Eyebrow Label:** BLIND SPOT 02
    - **Title:** Incomplete Traffic Context
    - **Main Body:** Sales figures tell you what happened at the register. They reveal nothing about peak traffic hours, how long customers stayed, which zones they visited, or when staff were misaligned with demand.
    - **Footer Quote:** "Were we understaffed at 2pm, or did the floor layout stop customers from engaging?"
    
    #### CARD 3 (Right):
    - **Eyebrow Label:** BLIND SPOT 03
    - **Title:** Delayed Recognition
    - **Main Body:** Conversion problems surface in weekly reports, days after the window to act has closed. By the time a district manager sees the number, the customers — and the revenue — are already gone.
    - **Footer Quote:** "Why did conversion drop last Thursday afternoon? Nobody knows."
    
    ### 5. Shopify Architecture & Schema Requirements
    - Map all eyebrow labels, titles, main paragraphs, footer quotes, SVG icons, and container color variables to block configuration inputs within the Liquid schema to make the entire section 100% customizable in the Shopify editor.
    - Scope all custom CSS styles exclusively to the unique section ID (`#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}`) to strictly enforce absolute zero style leakage across other templates.
    - Enforce clean responsive scaling: Ensure columns flex smoothly on tablet viewports and scale fluidly to narrow screen sizes without text clipping or uneven row heights.
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase
%}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-header-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_box_background }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    border: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-footer-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_label_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-footer-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_quote_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ai-blind-spots-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-blind-spots-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
